1
00:00:00,661 --> 00:00:06,685
A manager signs in to handle the new online order.

2
00:00:06,685 --> 00:00:08,492
In Online Orders, request #2 appears at the top with the green "Live" indicator.

3
00:00:08,492 --> 00:00:16,640
They tap Accept — the customer’s tracking page advances to "Confirmed".

4
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:19,825
On the POS, the new ticket appears in the open tickets list.

5
00:00:19,825 --> 00:00:23,021
Items are already on their way to the kitchen.

6
00:00:23,021 --> 00:00:29,073
On the Kitchen Display, the order appears with customer name, items, allergens, and pickup time.

7
00:00:29,073 --> 00:00:38,120
They bump each item as it leaves the pass — green ✓ Ready badges replace the buttons.

8
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,922
Back on the POS with every line served — "Close ticket" is now active.

9
00:00:39,922 --> 00:00:43,400
With every line served, "Close ticket" opens the payment dialog.

10
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:46,307
They keep the tip at "No tip", select Card, and tap Pay.

11
00:00:46,307 --> 00:00:55,179
A brief "Processing card payment…" overlay turns into a green "Payment received".

12
00:00:55,179 --> 00:00:58,681
Ticket closed. The customer’s tracking page now advances to "Picked up — Order complete!".
